Questions: 

01. Create a program that finds the first non-repeating character in a string. 
02. Write a script that converts camelCase to snake_case. 
03. Write a function to generate acronyms from a sentence. 
04. Write a script to check if a file contains a specific word. 
05. Write a Python program to find and replace text in a file. 
06. Write a script that checks if all characters in a string are digits. 
07. Write a program to calculate the average word length in a sentence. 
08. Create a function that removes all HTML tags from a string. 
09. Write a program to parse a date string and display it in a different format. 
10. Write a script that finds all email addresses in a given text. 
11. Write a program that counts the occurrence of each vowel in a paragraph. 
12. Create a function that validates an email address format. 
13. Write a script to check if a string is a valid URL. 
14. Write a program that extracts all integers from a given text. 
15. Create a script to find duplicate words in a paragraph. 
16. Write a program that converts a sentence to Pig Latin. 
17. Write a script that finds the longest sentence in a paragraph. 
18. Write a Python program to read a file and display all lines that contain a given keyword. 
19. Write a script to clean a text file by removing extra spaces and blank lines. 
20. Write a Python program to count how many sentences are in a paragraph.